          "id": "c12fc4dc-2e27-44e6-b689-abdb85830266",
          "name": "Query entitled universe to retrieve investment metadata",
          "request": {
            "name": "Query entitled universe to retrieve investment metadata",
            "description": {
              "content": "\n**Get Universe Entitlements**\n\nRetrieve the **primary filters** your account is entitled for.\n\n| Scenario| Request Inputs |\n|-----------|-------|\n| Get equities entitlements.| `GET /investments`|\n| Get managed investments entitlements.| `GET /investments?source=managedInvestments` |\n\n**Get Custom Universe**\n\nRetrieve a custom universe in full.\n\n| Scenario| Request Inputs |\n|-----------|-------|\n| Get equities custom universe.| `GET /investments?universe=MY_EQUITIES_ABC`|\n| Get managed investments custom universe.| `GET /investments?source=managedInvestments&universe=MY_MANAGED_INVESTMENTS_XYZ`|\n\n**Filter Equities**\n\nFurther narrow a custom universe or filter full universe.\n\n| Scenario| Request Inputs |\n|-----------|-------|\n| Filter custom universe by primary filter.| `GET /investments?exchangeCode=XPAR&universe=MY_EQUITIES_ABC` |\n| Filter custom universe by primary and secondary filter.| `GET /investments?exchangeCode=XPAR&securityType=ST00000001&universe=MY_EQUITIES_ABC` |\n| Filter full universe by primary filter only.| `GET /investments?exchangeCode=XPAR` |\n| Filter full universe by primary and 1 secondary filter.| `GET /investments?exchangeCode=XPAR&securityType=ST00000001` |\n| Filter full universe by primary and 2 secondary filters.| `GET /investments?exchangeCode=XPAR&shareClassInformationInvestmentType=ST00000001&securityType=ST00000001` |\n\n\n**Filter Managed Investments**\n\nFurther narrow a custom universe or filter full universe.\n\n| Scenario| Request Inputs |\n|-----------|-------|\n| Filter custom universe by a primary filter.| `GET /investments?source=managedInvestments&domicileCode=USA&universe=MY_MANAGED_INVESTMENTS_XYZ`|\n| Filter managed investments by a primary filter (`countryAvailableForSaleCode`) | `GET /investments?source=managedInvestments&countryAvailableForSaleCode=USA`|\n| Filter managed investments by a primary filter (`domicileCode`) | `GET /investments?source=managedInvestments&domicileCode=USA`|\n\n\n**Retrieve Results Using Pagination Tokens**\n\nSet pagination preferences in inital request and retrieve paginated results using tokens.\n\n| Scenario| Request Inputs |\n|-----------|-------|\n| Pagination settings initial request (default `pageSize`).| `GET /investments?exchangeCode=XPAR` |\n| Pagination settings subsequent requests (default `pageSize`).| `GET /investments?exchangeCode=XPAR&paginationTokenNext=CJjVEBoTOhE`|\n| Pagination settings initial request (explicit `pageSize`).| `GET /investments?exchangeCode=XPAR&pageSize=25` |\n| Pagination settings subsequent requests (explicit `pageSize`).| `GET /investments?exchangeCode=XPAR&pageSize=25&paginationTokenNext=CJjVEBoTOhE`|",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "direct-web-services",
                "v1",
                "investments"
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "universe",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "Filters results to a custom universe defined during implementation for the account."
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "source",
                  "value": "equities",
                  "description": "Specifies the investment data type to query."
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "exchangeCode",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "Primary filter for equities. Filters results by exchange code."
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "securityType",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "Secondary filter for equities. Accepts:\n\n  *   `ST00000001` - Common Stock\n  *   `ST00000002` - Preferred Stock\n  *   `ST00000003` - Industry\n  *   `ST00000004` - Index\n  *   `ST00000005` - ETF\n  *   `ST00000006` - Closed-end Fund\n  *   `ST00000007` - Investment Trusts\n  *   `ST00000008` - Warrant\n  *   `ST00000009` - Note\n  *   `ST000000A1` - Units\n  *   `ST000000B1` - Rights\n  *   `ST000000C1` - Unlisted Common\n  *   `ST000000C2` - Unlisted Preferred"
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "countryAvailableForSaleCode",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "Primary filter for managed investments. Accepts 3-character ISO 3166-1 country codes."
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "domicileCode",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "Primary filter for managed investments. Accepts 3-character ISO 3166-1 country codes."
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "shareClassInformationInvestmentType",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "Secondary filter for equities.\n\nAccepts:\n\n  *   `EQ` - Equity\n  *   `DR` - Depository Receipt\n  *   `PE` - Preferred Equity\n  *   `UE` - Unlisted Equity"
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "paginationTokenNext",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "Specifies the token to fetch the next page of results."
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "paginationTokenPrevious",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "Specifies the token to fetch the previous page of results."
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "pageSize",
                  "value": "50",
                  "description": "Specifies the number of records per page."
                }
              ],
              "variable": []
            },
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "method": "GET",
            "auth": null
          },
